Squashed backport of litehtml 0.10 support for the qlitehtml copy bundled in
qttools 6.11.x, which still pins qlitehtml 3fe5821dad98747d6e41c9ed54b86c3d0eee9daf.

Source changes of these upstream commits from
https://code.qt.io/cgit/playground/qlitehtml.git :

    c76136a DocumentContainerPrivate: use tag instead of tagName for known elements
    0dd32c2 Avoid creation of temporary std::string
    b7e9ad1 Fix jumping to anchors with '.' in the name
    5764675 Fix jumping to anchors with upper case letters in the id
    2665704 namespace all symbols
    1f56cfe Update to litehtml 0.10

Paths are rewritten to the qttools tarball layout and the src/3rdparty/litehtml
submodule bump of 1f56cfe is omitted, as GNU patch cannot patch a gitlink.

